				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a393b8b at-image-animation at-animation-image-style-1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="a393b8b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="image.default" style="transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1; visibility: inherit;">
															<img decoding="async" width="210" height="73" src="./UdbhavShanthi6_files/udbhav-shanthi-logo-v2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-6835" alt="" style="transform: translate(0px, 0px);">															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6c1c2a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor animated fadeInUp" data-id="6c1c2a3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									Udbhav Developers invites you to experience Udbhav Shanthi, an exclusive 8 residential apartments which is the pinnacle for modern day living. Located in the prestigious neighbourhood of Kadri, in the vicinity of the famous Sri Manjunatha Swamy Temple, experience divine serenity along with an exclusive lifestyle. The location also provides good connectivity to major hubs of Mangalore. With retail &amp; commercial space for Exclusive Outlets, Supermarkets, &amp; Private Offces on the ground foor, this apartment complex is going to be a new landmark in Kadri. One can also be rest assured with our promise of a great build quality &amp; premium amenities that will make you lead a life for the discerning few.								</div>
